WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:01.810
It is the period of warring states.{these top three lines were from previous ep and should not be changed or edited}{line taken from Sage's sub}

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:03.940
The era of competing warlords.{line taken from Sage's sub}

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:06.440
Halt, Ieyasu!

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:09.480
Mitsunari, I will see you
where we promised to meet!

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:12.650
Where we promised to meet...

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:17.910
It will all lead up to Sekigahara.{line taken from Sage's sub}

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.550
<b>It is almost two point
five decades since I was born</b>

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:34.930
<b>I've had so many of jellos so far</b>

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:37.720
<b>and how many more will I swallow from now on?</b>

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:41.180
<b>I've already taken tons of exams</b>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.640
<b>and what else is coming up to me from now on?</b>

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:46.810
<b>Daily lives must pass by quickly
without any "likes" and "hates"</b>

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:48.480
<b>That girl who falls for guys easily,</b>

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:50.940
<b>fell for another one then another
one and another one each time</b>

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:52.360
<b>For a guy without such experience</b>

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:56.610
<b>Everyday life now is like a stormy river</b>

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:57.820
<b>So fast!</b>

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:02.120
<b>Break out!</b>

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:10.500
<b>(so) I sing to myself before I get sunk</b>

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:15.380
<b>I jumped out to stop the streaming days</b>

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:21.930
<b>The coastline I ran on that strong sunny day
(Shore line I ran)</b>

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:26.600
<b>If you wanna take back that feeling
(take back that feeling)</b>

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:30.860
<b>That feeling and give it a deep color of your own self
(take back that feeling)</b>

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:33.780
<b>First, smash down that door</b>

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:50.210
Promise

00:01:50.550 --> 00:01:53.760
Lord Masamune,
once we get past Lake Biwa,

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:56.010
up ahead is Osaka, the Toyotomi stronghold.

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:59.350
We sure took one heck of a detour.

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:00.220
Kojuro.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:00.980
Sir!

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:03.350
From here on out,
we're taking the shortest route.

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:05.690
To seizing the country!

00:02:05.690 --> 00:02:06.730
Yes, Sir!

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:09.440
I'm counting on you to have my back, Kojuro!

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:11.030
As you wish!

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:14.990
You guys, sorry for ending up on that detour.

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:18.490
"Ogre of the Western Sea"

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:18.160
This is what I get for getting all
bigheaded about being king of the hill

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:20.160
and not taking things seriously.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:24.750
But my ship isn't gonna waver anymore.

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:38.050
Wha...

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:39.060
Boss!

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:41.640
You're acting like you don't
know us, going off on your own!

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.520
No matter where you go...

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:46.560
We're coming with you!

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:48.730
You guys...

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:54.280
All right! Let's go make this battle
for vengeance one for the books!

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:56.860
Boss!

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:01.950
Those who come close
will be reduced to ashes.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:04.160
The last one to remain standing will be I.

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:10.500
Lady O-Ichi, where have you gone?

00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:15.090
Kasuga...

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:21.930
I have to go...

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:40.830
Where the vortex of light and the
vortex of darkness meld together...

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:42.540
To that place...

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:47.830
Commander!

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:51.460
Hup!

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:54.800
It looks like the other side is
headed for the Kyoto-Osaka area, too.

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:56.260
The Kyoto-Osaka area?

00:03:56.260 --> 00:03:57.630
What in the world for?

00:03:57.630 --> 00:03:59.590
Their goal isn't apparent.

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:02.970
Also, the movement of the
Saika people concerns me, too.

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:10.440
Lady Magoichi.

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:13.610
Are you feeling better?

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:16.650
Matsu! Sis! You shouldn't be pushing yourself!

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:18.400
Keiji, it is fine.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:22.780
And besides, you have a question
for me, do you not, Lady Magoichi?

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:26.750
About what that man said.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:31.040
Lord Nobunaga's body... his soul...

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:34.590
Oh! They will be resurrected!

00:04:34.590 --> 00:04:36.590
He is serious.

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:39.880
He is likely trying to use
Lady O-Ichi as a medium

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:42.180
and to call forth Oda Nobunaga,
the Devil King of the Sixth Heaven

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:43.890
into this world.

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.770
Such a thing...

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:49.140
I will never let it happen!

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:51.730
Wh-What's wrong, Magoichi?

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:54.400
Getting all worked up. This isn't like you.

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:58.400
We of the Saika Folk and
Oda Nobunaga, the Devil King,

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:00.240
once met in battle.

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:04.660
It was bitterly fierce.

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:07.790
The previous Saika Magoichi was killed.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:10.830
The home of the Saika was reduced to ashes.

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:13.210
And many were killed.

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:15.800
Never again...

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:20.590
...will I allow him to defile another,
no matter who it is!

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:23.430
That is why I succeeded the name of Magoichi.

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:25.890
Lady Magoichi, I, too, shall accompany you.

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:27.140
Wha...?!

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:31.600
It is my responsibility, as someone
who once sided with the Oda.

00:05:34.610 --> 00:05:36.070
Osaka

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:41.900
Here we've come all this way
to check out the enemy camp,

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:44.570
and they don't even have dumplings?
Talk about being hard up.

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:48.410
It seems their food was
taken in preparation for war.

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:53.250
I hear that what little rice they
have has also doubled in price.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:56.630
I guess it's always the weak
who bear the brunt of things.

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:05.850
Hey!

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:08.390
Where do you think you're looking?!

00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:10.470
You were the ones who bumped into us!

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:13.690
What's this? You Shimazu
troops aren't even <i>from</i> here!

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:18.270
We answered the call to
bring down the Tokugawa,

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:19.940
but that does not mean we bow to the Toyotomi!

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:21.990
You mean to defy us?

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:24.410
Don't mess with Satsuma!

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:30.240
Stop this!

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:31.370
The Takeda's...

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:34.500
We are all equals who rallied
together under the same banner.

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:36.330
If you have an objection with that,

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:38.460
bring the matter to Master Ishida's attention!

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:49.850
Master Sanada, we are
sorry to have troubled you.

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:51.890
Pay it no mind.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:57.020
What the what?

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:58.480
What is the matter, Sasuke?

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:01.360
Well, we've got some surprising visitors...

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:03.860
Yo.

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:04.900
Wha...?!

00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:09.030
Lord Masamune, what brings you to this place?

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:11.200
You know, checking out the enemy camp.

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:14.210
If so, I cannot silently stand by
and allow you to leave!

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:16.670
Then, you wanna get into it here?

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.750
<i>I</i> wouldn't mind.

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:23.840
We'll probably end up dragging
a lot of others into it, though.

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:26.510
Involving the townspeople would be unacceptable.

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:30.390
OK! Then take a little tea break with me.

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:33.390
By the way,

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:37.350
you said earlier that they should
take any grievances to Ishida.

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:40.480
The way you see it, what kind of man is Ishida?

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:46.070
Master Ishida is a man who
approaches all matters rigorously,

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:48.740
which sets a standard of
integrity for both himself and others.

00:07:48.740 --> 00:07:51.910
That's why you allied with him?

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:53.370
We are the same.

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:54.580
The same?

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:57.370
Master Ishida, bereft of his liege,

00:07:57.370 --> 00:08:01.380
is the same as I, when I became
lost when my lord collapsed.

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:03.750
Are you saying that he's also feeling lost?

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.590
That, I do not know.

00:08:05.590 --> 00:08:09.760
However, it is my desire to be
there for Master Ishida during this time.

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:13.890
That's so like you.

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:18.640
By the bye, why have you thrown
your support behind Lord Tokugawa?

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.940
It was a bit of manly jealousy.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:25.730
Jealousy?!

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:32.910
He's holding up this ridiculous ideal

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:37.870
and he's just single-mindedly
working towards it.

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:41.710
And shouldering all the responsibility himself.

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:43.710
He looks up to my lord as his mentor

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:48.050
and we are both warriors living in the same era,

00:08:48.050 --> 00:08:51.590
and yet, the difference between
myself and Lord Tokugawa is great.

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:54.050
Yeah.

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:56.770
That's why I'll stand next to him,
and then overtake him!

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:04.190
Sanada, this'll be my treat.

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:05.070
What?

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:07.280
I'm reserving the party.

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:10.570
I'll be waiting, Sanada Yukimura.

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:12.990
I could not have asked for more!

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:25.340
It seems those to the
west are not solidly unified.

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:26.300
Yeah.

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:28.630
But that stuff doesn't matter.

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:31.010
I'll fight against whomever I want to fight

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:32.890
and overtake whomever I want to overtake.

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:36.140
That Lord Date's the same as ever.

00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:39.020
Yes, he remains unchanged.

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:42.230
He is exactly as the old Date Masamune was.

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:44.860
He is my rival!

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:54.320
What?!

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:55.990
He betrayed us, you say?!

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:59.370
The Venerable Tenkai cut down
those of the Oda he had brought with him

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:02.040
and even tried to cut down his own ninja,

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:04.170
and so, the circumstances
were such that I intervened.

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:06.540
Gyobu, what is going on here?!

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:11.590
It seems he was plotting
something without my knowledge.

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:12.840
Tenkai...

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:15.720
So, what became of the Lady O-Ichi?

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:17.600
Her whereabouts are unknown.

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:21.350
She has been reduced to an eerie
darkness that is no longer human.

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:22.890
Gyobu!

00:10:24.230 --> 00:10:27.980
You allowed such rabble to join the Toyotomi?!

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:30.730
Please do not do this!

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:33.360
Master Ishida, you are the supreme commander.

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.990
If you are not prepared to
take responsibility in all things,

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:38.530
you will not win this war.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:43.330
Why you...

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:58.720
So? What're we going to do, Commander?

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:00.430
We're about to have a showdown

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:02.890
and you're lecturing the supreme commander?

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:13.190
<i>Mitsunari, recall for me...</i>

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:15.360
<i>...the promise we made that day.</i>

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:22.080
The enemy's numbers are small!

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:25.620
Once our reinforcements arrive,
they will quickly lose their will to fight!

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:27.080
Ieyasu!

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:29.670
Mitsunari!

00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:32.670
I have arrived with Lord Hideyoshi's
troops under my command.

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:34.260
I have been waiting for you.

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:37.260
So they are the rebels
who dare to defy the Toyotomi.

00:11:37.260 --> 00:11:38.260
Yes.

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:40.550
Seeing the reinforcements you brought,

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:42.560
they should surrender before long.

00:11:42.560 --> 00:11:44.680
What are you saying, Ieyasu?!

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:47.140
They are guilty men,
who rose up against Lord Hideyoshi.

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:49.360
I will not permit a single one of them to live!

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:51.610
Do not say that.

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:54.230
Rather than the lives
lost to needless slaughter,

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:57.150
it will be the forging of bonds
with the surviving soldiers and officers

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:59.160
that will serve to bring peace to this country.

00:11:59.160 --> 00:12:03.370
Lord Hideyoshi will not
tolerate such cajoling talk.

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:08.830
A retreat?

00:12:18.180 --> 00:12:19.300
A trap?!

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:20.050
Mitsunari!

00:12:22.890 --> 00:12:24.720
Curse you rebels!

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:26.310
Wait, Mitsunari!

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:32.730
Hidden troops?!

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:35.940
Mitsunari!

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:44.200
This is why I told you!

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:46.540
Your soft ways will kill the troops!

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:51.210
You go east. I will take care of the west.

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:53.960
All right.

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:49.020
So, it is over...

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:50.390
Yes.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:58.070
Mitsunari.

00:13:58.070 --> 00:14:02.700
I believe that bonds are forged,
even in the midst of battles.

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:04.950
And that it can happen even between enemies.

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:08.330
I believe in the country
that Lord Hideyoshi will forge.

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:09.660
And also...

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:14.000
...in the bond I share with Lord Hideyoshi.

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:17.420
This may be fanciful of me,

00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:20.840
but someday, my friend, if I might
have the chance to share with you...

00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:24.130
I would like to try fighting you as well.

00:14:25.470 --> 00:14:27.470
Then we will do it here.

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:30.390
Once Lord Hideyoshi has united this country,

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:33.810
he will surely permit us that much sport.

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:36.610
We will go petition him together.

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:38.900
Yes.

00:14:38.900 --> 00:14:40.530
It is a promise.

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:53.540
Mitsunari...

00:14:56.040 --> 00:15:00.500
I am going to ask you to bear with
my fanciful ideas just one more time.

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:10.010
What is it?

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:12.390
Have you come to lecture me again?

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:16.900
Master Ishida, the reason I looked
to you as the supreme commander

00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:18.230
is because I judged

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:21.780
that you were a man worthy of
wagering everything upon in this war.

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:24.900
Master Otani and all the many other lords

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:27.070
may each have their own thoughts, but...

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:31.620
It is because they believe that you
are worth wagering everything upon!

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:40.340
You do not understand how we feel at all!

00:15:40.340 --> 00:15:45.380
Lord Toyotomi Hideyoshi died in the
battle for Odawara and he is not here!

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:46.680
Why you!

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:48.390
Even with Lord Hideyoshi gone,

00:15:48.390 --> 00:15:51.140
all those who still rallied to the Toyotomi...

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:53.680
See what is in their hearts!

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:58.440
I wished to fight together with you,
<i>because</i> it was you.

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:01.060
That is how we all feel.

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:06.240
We all wish to hear...

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:08.660
...what is in your heart.

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:10.700
To hear your true voice.

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:14.240
To think that there would
be another, other than Gyobu,

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:17.750
who would admonish me to such an extent.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:36.390
First, for the bond that I share
with all of you who have gathered here,

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:39.190
I want to express my gratitude.

00:16:39.190 --> 00:16:40.440
Thank you!

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:51.280
All of you, hear me!

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:53.530
That's...

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:57.450
Since ancient times,
this foolish land of the rising sun

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:00.210
has long continued to fight wars over land.

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:01.790
As a result,

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:05.550
it allowed for such brutality as
Oda Nobunaga, the Devil King.

00:17:05.550 --> 00:17:07.050
Master Ishida...

00:17:07.050 --> 00:17:10.800
However, the Devil King,
too, died at the hands of betrayal.

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:14.300
When that happened,
this country truly ceased to exist

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:18.020
and we became exposed,
vulnerable to other countries.

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:21.980
But the one who rose to action
with great strength and majesty

00:17:21.980 --> 00:17:24.230
was Lord Hideyoshi!

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:27.860
Lord Hideyoshi tried to change this country.

00:17:27.860 --> 00:17:30.740
Into a strong country
that none could ever violate.

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:34.990
United under Lord Hideyoshi's rule,
this land of the rising sun

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:37.080
would become a strong and enduring country!

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:39.120
Everyone was sure to have believed that!

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:42.710
But that Lord Hideyoshi is no more.

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:47.170
That man... Tokugawa Ieyasu,
who had sworn his loyalty to the Toyotomi,

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:51.510
betrayed and killed Lord Hideyoshi!

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:58.140
He drew this country back into the
downward spiral of war once again!

00:17:58.140 --> 00:18:00.810
Right now, this country is split in two.

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:03.900
The armies of the western lands,
unified under the Toyotomi,

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:05.520
have declared themselves the Western Forces

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:08.400
and intend to rule the land
of the rising sun with strength.

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:12.280
If they win, the land of the
rising sun may become united as one.

00:18:12.280 --> 00:18:14.780
But is strength really the way to go?

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:18.410
What do we do if an even
greater power emerges in our future?

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:23.710
Just how long must we continue
to climb these endless steps?

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:27.540
If there are any among you
who are dissatisfied with my way

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:31.880
or wish to join the Western Forces,
I want you to feel free to do so.

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:34.680
Takechiyo, what are you...?!

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:38.260
The battle we are about to
engage in is sure to prove exacting.

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:41.730
Many will shed their blood and lose their lives.

00:18:41.730 --> 00:18:42.810
That is exactly why

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:45.940
I want you to think for yourselves
about this country's future.

00:18:50.360 --> 00:18:52.610
We climb the endless steps of war

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:54.240
and this will be the end!

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:57.030
The one who turned traitor declares his yearning

00:18:57.030 --> 00:19:00.370
for a peace that is covered up with lies!

00:19:00.370 --> 00:19:03.830
But I denounce it all!

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:06.710
No matter what cajoling words
he uses to mislead others,

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:10.750
there can be no truth in
something born of betrayal!

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:14.380
Lord Hideyoshi took me in.

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:16.180
When I was young, I was weak.

00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:19.350
I did not have the means to live... Nay!
Not even a <i>reason</i> to live!

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:23.770
I was a creature who merely breathed,
existing only to be beat down.

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:28.150
It was Lord Hideyoshi who
gave me, that creature, a life.

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:30.020
Lord Hideyoshi and Lord Hanbei...

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:31.650
I owe it to those two men...

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:35.450
It was only then that I came
to have a normal life.

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:38.820
What lies beyond this
battle is unthinkable to me.

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:42.540
Those who survive can think upon it.

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:45.660
Over and over, I will raise
my voice for the bonds we share.

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:48.830
All of you resolved to forge a bond with me!

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:51.420
There is no rank, higher or lower, between us.

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:53.420
We are comrades who fight side-by-side!

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:56.170
So I want all of you to believe as well.

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:58.050
That we will win this war

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:02.350
and we will bring peace to the
land of the rising sun for all eternity!

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:04.890
Let us go!

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:06.810
The thing that will lead this country to peace

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:08.560
is the strength of our bonds!

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:15.440
There was nothing
for me except Lord Hideyoshi.

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:20.780
As I am now, I may not be
worthy of leading this great army.

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:23.540
As a general, I am hollow.

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:27.620
But even so, there were
those who put their faith in me.

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:30.040
To fill all the cracks that I had left exposed,

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.880
there was one who sullied his own hands.

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:36.130
Another swore that I would have his support.

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:37.510
I am grateful.

00:20:37.510 --> 00:20:40.340
And I want you to exchange pledges with me!

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:43.140
That we will offer up our lives
to the fullest, that we will fight,

00:20:43.140 --> 00:20:45.270
and that we will win!

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:48.600
Here we go! There is but one thing we must do!

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:52.310
Condemnation to the false bond
that the east holds aloft as their banner!

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:54.980
Death to Ieyasu!

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.610
Mitsunari...

00:21:10.210 --> 00:21:12.540
<i>The country hangs in the
balance upon Sekigahara.</i>

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:15.710
<i>At long last, the battle for supremacy begins.</i>

00:21:15.710 --> 00:21:18.420
The decisive battle will be at Sekigahara!

